---
---

<section id="contato" class="contact-section" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="contact.eyebrow">Contato</p>
        <h2 id="contact-title" data-i18n="contact.title">Fale com a Founders AI</h2>
      </div>
      <p data-i18n="contact.desc">
        Estamos prontos para ajudar sua empresa a adotar inteligência artificial com governança e infraestrutura de confiança.
        Entre em contato pelos canais abaixo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-panel">
      <div class="contact-copy">
        <h2 data-i18n="contact.more.title">Quer saber mais?</h2>
        <p data-i18n="contact.more.desc">
          Acompanhe o projeto no GitHub e entre em contato diretamente com nossa equipe para iniciar seu projeto de IA.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/keltec-max/founders-ai"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-link"
          data-i18n="contact.more.link"
          >repositório no GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
        >

        <div class="contact-channels">
          <h3 data-i18n="contact.channels.title">Canais de contato</h3>
          <ul role="list" class="channel-list">
            <li class="channel-item">
              <span class="channel-label" data-i18n="contact.channels.email">E-mail</span>
              <a href="mailto:contato@founders-ai.com" class="channel-value" data-i18n="contact.channels.email-value">contato@founders-ai.com</a>
            </li>
            <li class="channel-item">
              <span class="channel-label" data-i18n="contact.channels.phone">Telefone</span>
              <span class="channel-value" data-i18n="contact.channels.phone-value">+55 (11) 3000-0000</span>
            </li>
            <li class="channel-item">
              <span class="channel-label" data-i18n="contact.channels.linkedin">LinkedIn</span>
              <a href="https://linkedin.com/company/founders-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="channel-value" data-i18n="contact.channels.linkedin-value">founders-ai</a>
            </li>
            <li class="channel-item">
              <span class="channel-label" data-i18n="contact.channels.address">Endereço</span>
              <span class="channel-value" data-i18n="contact.channels.address-value">São Paulo, SP — Brasil</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-state">
        <h3 data-i18n="contact.status.title">Status do contato</h3>
        <p data-i18n="contact.status.active">Canal ativo. Respondemos em até 2 dias úteis.</p>
        <p data-i18n="contact.status.no-form">Sem formulário público — use o e-mail ou LinkedIn acima.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact-channels { margin-top: 30px; }
  .contact-channels h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 14px; color: var(--color-text); }
  .channel-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
  .channel-item { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-size: .9rem; }
  .channel-label { color: var(--color-muted); min-width: 110px; font-size: .82rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .channel-value { color: var(--color-text); word-break: break-all; }
  .channel-value a { color: var(--color-gold); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .channel-value a:hover { color: #e7cca0; }
</style>